# Agents
# Shared agent instructions and tooling ARE tracked so every harness — and every
# teammate — gets them: AGENTS.md (canonical, with CLAUDE.md symlinked to it),
# .agents/skills/ (with .claude/skills symlinked to it), and .mcp.json.
# Only per-user state stays ignored:
.claude/settings.local.json
skills-lock.json
